// Everything that can sit in an inventory. `rustRef` is the Rust item shortname,
// which is also what icon packs name their files after.
// `tier` is rarity on the base-tier colour scale (twig = primitive, hqm = top).
// `capacity`: storage boxes add this to the cap of every resource. `workbenchLevel`: what a
// workbench item unlocks. Recipes are in recipes.json5. Gear stats arrive with Phase 3.
//
// The planned set, kept deliberately small; the ~120 blueprints of the account
// layer include tool tiers, furnaces and upgrades, not just these.
